md/uname/main.go` implementing R1.1-R1.4. The implementation should:\n   - Use `syscall.Uname(&utsname)` to get system info\n   - Include a helper function to convert the fixed-size int8/byte arrays (like `utsname.Sysname`) to Go strings by finding the null terminator\n   - Parse flags manually (since the standard `flag` package doesn't support single-character flags without `-` prefix well, and we need POSIX-style `-snr` combined flags)\n   - Print selected fields space-separated with trailing newline\n   - Default to kernel name (sysname) when no flags given\n   - Structure with a flag-to-field mapping pattern so R1.5-R1.9 can be added later\n   \n   From the task: \"Implement srd044-uname R1.1: create cmd/uname/main.go with package main, call sys.InstallSIGPIPEHandler() at start of main, implement default behavior (print kernel name to stdout with trailing newline when no flags given)\"\n\nIf you need specific details from before compaction (like exact code snippets, error messages, or content you generated), read the full transcript at: /Users/pdiddy/.claude/projects/-private-var-folders-dl-cbns6zkx7txc7pt64b6cgzp40000gn-T-go-unix-utils-worktrees-5196/f7039a9e-9225-44ca-a28d-bff949cf7958.jsonl\nContinue the conversation from where it left off without asking the user any further questions. Resume directly — do not acknowledge the summary, do not recap what was happening, do not preface with \"I'll continue\" or similar. Pick up the last task as if the break never happened."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f7039a9e-9225-44ca-a28d-bff949cf7958","uuid":"90890651-e8b3-4e8e-93d3-13653708f50c","timestamp":"2026-05-14T17:33:14.579Z","isSynthetic":true}
